# Logs
# Anchored to the repo root: a bare `logs` also matched src/pages/Attendance/Logs/
# (git ignores case on Windows), so that page was never committed.
/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

